                <pb facs="0269" n="175" sameAs="frus:frus1930v03/pg175"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure—Translation]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting President of Guatemala</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Palma</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to President
                        Hoover</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName> [<date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-12-12">December 12, 1930</date>].</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: As General Lazaro Chacon, President
                    of the Republic, is unable to exercise his functions because of a severe
                    illness, I have been called upon by the Council of Ministers, in accordance with
                    the Constitution, to assume charge of the Presidency of the Republic as I have
                    the honor to communicate to Your Excellency.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Baudilio Palma</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
